            "review_text": "duy anh\nHanoi, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nGreat food, creative cocktails & warm service at Lapis Hanoi – highly recommended for anyone looking for a stylish, cozy\nSep 2025 • Business\nI had a wonderful evening at Lapis – Mixology & Cuisine in Hang Trong. The restaurant offers a perfect blend of modern design and cozy atmosphere. The food was excellent—beautifully presented dishes that combine Asian and European flavors with balance and creativity. The cocktails were another highlight: inventive, well-crafted, and a true showcase of mixology. Our server, Trung, made the experience even more memorable with his friendly and attentive service, offering spot-on food and drink pairings. Overall, Lapis is a must-visit in Hanoi for anyone who values great cuisine, cocktails, and hospitality.\nRead more\nWritten September 18, 2025",
